  "Overview": "Classic Maze Chase Game with a Twist!\n\nPlay a cat-and-mouse game as you race against time to collect all the castle’s treasures.\n\nGAMEPLAY\n\n- Play as both Thief and Guards! Switch when the Thief is caught!\n- Use each character’s special ability to gain the upper hand.\n- No time to lose! Remember, only the Thief can collect treasures.\n- Challenge mode: catch all thieves!\n\nGET FREE NEW CONTENT\n\nJoin the community and send your treasures to the Band of Thieves’ Vault to unlock new levels and contents. The more you play, the more you get!\n\nUNLOCKABLE FEATURES: 500 000 gold\n\n- New Guard Challenge\n- Leaderboard",
